==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la}} {{term|prosecutus|prōsecūtus|lang=la}}, perfect participle of {{term|prosequor|prōsequor|lang=la}}. Compare {{term|persecute|lang=en}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|prosecut|ing}}

# {{transitive|legal}} To [[start]] [[civil]] or [[criminal]] [[proceeding]]s against.
# {{transitive|legal}} To [[charge]], [[try]].
# {{transitive}} To [[pursue]] something to the [[end]].

